MintCurveConvexPositionFactory::createPosition(address)
├── given beacon is not set
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryBeaconNotSet
└── given beacon is set
    ├── when market is not a registered mint market
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryUnsupportedMarket
    └── when market is a registered mint market
        ├── it should deploy a BeaconProxy for msg.sender
        ├── it should initialize the position with msg.sender as owner
        ├── it should initialize the position with address(this) as factory
        ├── it should initialize the position with the market
        └── it should emit PositionCreated
